    "title": "Balloon release held for father of 7-week-old killed in Almeda crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Angie Rodriguez ,\n6 hours ago HOUSTON - On November 2, Houston Police say a drunk driver ran a red light at the intersection of West Orem Drive and Almeda Road in Southwest Houston. The driver, identified as 29-year-old Tony Jerome Oliver, has since been charged with \"intoxication manslaughter — death of multiple people\" after the accident. He remains hospitalized per HPD. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
